cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use NIM Studio in research, please cite the exact version used
  using the metadata below.
title: "NIM Studio: Neuroinformatics Management Studio"
type: software
version: "0.1.0-beta"
date-released: "2026-07-10"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21296291"

authors:
  - family-names: "Monteiro"
    given-names: "Sara"

abstract: >-
  NIM Studio (Neuroinformatics Management Studio) is a desktop application
  for neuroinformatics, research data management, FAIR data stewardship,
  BIDS-oriented dataset organization, metadata workflows, duplicate auditing,
  and research infrastructure support. Version 0.1.0-beta is an evaluation
  release. Public documentation and project materials are available under
  Apache License 2.0. The first public application source-code release is
  planned for January 2027; source code is not yet included in this repository.

keywords:
  - "neuroinformatics"
  - "neuroimaging"
  - "BIDS"
  - "FAIR data"
  - "research data management"
  - "metadata"
  - "data governance"
  - "neuroscience"

